  "idea": "AppFlowy: the open-source Notion replacement that stays local",
  "text": "This is the cleanest free notes and project management tool on the internet. Teams get bogged down by cluttered interfaces and sluggish loading times on bloated cloud software. Feature bloat and forced cloud sync introduce lag that constantly disrupts your deep work. AppFlowy combines minimalist design with blazing-fast local desktop architecture, responsive tables, and nested document trees. You enjoy instant page transitions while keeping total privacy.",
